    "iCloud Drive를 사용할 수 없습니다. iCloud Drive가 켜져 있는지 확인해 주세요.|iCloud Drive is unavailable. Check that iCloud Drive is turned on." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Driveを利用できません。iCloud Driveがオンになっているか確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud 云盘不可用。请检查 iCloud 云盘是否已开启。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無法使用 iCloud 雲碟。請確認已開啟 iCloud 雲碟。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Drive ist nicht verfügbar. Prüfe, ob iCloud Drive eingeschaltet ist."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Drive n'est pas disponible. Vérifiez qu'iCloud Drive est activé."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Drive non è disponibile. Controlla che iCloud Drive sia attivo."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Drive no está disponible. Comprueba que iCloud Drive esté activado."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Drive indisponível. Verifique se o iCloud Drive está ativado."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Không dùng được iCloud Drive. Hãy kiểm tra xem iCloud Drive đã bật chưa."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Drive tidak tersedia. Pastikan iCloud Drive aktif."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ใช้ iCloud Drive ไม่ได้ ตรวจสอบว่าเปิด iCloud Drive อยู่"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Drive उपलब्ध नहीं है। जाँचें कि iCloud Drive चालू है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 계정 상태를 확인하지 못했습니다. 네트워크를 확인한 뒤 이 줄을 눌러주세요.|Could not check your iCloud account status. Check your network, then tap this row." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloudアカウントの状態を確認できませんでした。ネットワークを確認してから、この行をタップしてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法检查你的 iCloud 账户状态。请检查网络，然后点按此行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無法檢查你的 iCloud 帳號狀態。請檢查網路，然後點一下此列。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Status deines iCloud-Accounts konnte nicht geprüft werden. Prüfe dein Netzwerk und tippe dann auf diese Zeile."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impossible de vérifier l'état de votre compte iCloud. Vérifiez votre connexion, puis touchez cette ligne."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impossibile verificare lo stato del tuo account iCloud. Controlla la rete, poi tocca questa riga."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo comprobar el estado de tu cuenta de iCloud. Revisa la red y toca esta fila."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Não foi possível verificar o status da sua conta iCloud. Verifique a rede e toque nesta linha."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Không thể kiểm tra trạng thái tài khoản iCloud. Hãy kiểm tra mạng rồi nhấn vào hàng này."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Status akun iCloud tidak dapat diperiksa. Periksa jaringan Anda, lalu ketuk baris ini."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ตรวจสอบสถานะบัญชี iCloud ไม่ได้ ตรวจสอบเครือข่ายแล้วแตะแถวนี้"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "आपके iCloud खाते की स्थिति जाँची नहीं जा सकी। नेटवर्क जाँचें, फिर इस पंक्ति को दबाएँ।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 계정을 확인하는 중입니다. 잠시 뒤 이 줄을 눌러 다시 시도해주세요.|Checking your iCloud account. Tap this row again shortly to retry." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloudアカウントを確認中です。しばらくしてからこの行をもう一度タップして再試行してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在检查你的 iCloud 账户。请稍后再次点按此行重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在檢查你的 iCloud 帳號。稍後再點一下此列以重試。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein iCloud-Account wird geprüft. Tippe gleich noch einmal auf diese Zeile, um es erneut zu versuchen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vérification de votre compte iCloud. Touchez de nouveau cette ligne dans un instant pour réessayer."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verifica del tuo account iCloud. Tocca di nuovo questa riga tra poco per riprovare."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comprobando tu cuenta de iCloud. Vuelve a tocar esta fila en un momento para reintentar."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verificando sua conta iCloud. Toque nesta linha de novo em instantes para tentar outra vez."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Đang kiểm tra tài khoản iCloud. Hãy nhấn lại hàng này sau giây lát để thử lại."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Memeriksa akun iCloud Anda. Ketuk baris ini lagi sebentar lagi untuk mencoba ulang."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "กำลังตรวจสอบบัญชี iCloud แตะแถวนี้อีกครั้งในอีกสักครู่เพื่อลองใหม่"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "आपका iCloud खाता जाँचा जा रहा है। दोबारा कोशिश के लिए थोड़ी देर बाद यह पंक्ति फिर दबाएँ।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
